{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 34, "timestamp": 1788960494, "title": "Bullet Farm: a contained provider turn becomes a Candidate"}
[0.006111, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[0.006256, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;255m  BULLET FARM\u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255mone contained provider turn becomes a reviewable Candidate\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mhost xbabe2 \u00b7 claude 2.1.266 \u00b7 real account \u00b7 real spend \u00b7 recorded live\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.207903, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;213m1  The provider is a root-staged runtime, not whatever is on PATH\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;51m$ ls -l /usr/lib/bullet/providers/claude/2.1.266/bin/claude\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.210857, "o", "-r-xr-xr-x 1 root root 215940592 Sep  9 11:00 /usr/lib/bullet/providers/claude/2.1.266/bin/claude\r\n"]
[3.412773, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;51m$ b3sum .../bin/claude   vs   the enrolled digest\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.454763, "o", "23078eb938c327061efe99fa0e0f153915c57ef1f7c6c1955b782ba2ca5df9e0\r\n"]
[3.464072, "o", "\"executable_blake3\":\"23078eb938c327061efe99fa0e0f153915c57ef1f7c6c1955b782ba2ca5df9e0\"\r\n"]
[3.464332, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;46mthe enrollment pins that exact binary. any other one is refused.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.866014, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;213m2  The turn gets no network, no host environment, no writable tree\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.866106, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;255mbwrap --unshare-all --clearenv --ro-bind <clone> /workspace --chdir /workspace\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;255mslirp4netns + nftables default-drop, one allowlisted provider host\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;46mANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GH_TOKEN and SSH_AUTH_SOCK are dropped, not masked.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;46mdestructive writes are structurally impossible: there is nothing writable.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.66794, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;213m3  Running it now, on Bullet Farm's own kernel source\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.668012, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;51m$ proof-transaction-offline.sh   BULLET_TXN_PROVIDER=claude\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mfarmd + production gitd + the product Runner + a real provider turn\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[9.196777, "o", "\r  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;51m/\u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m  0s\u001b[0m   bwrap=4 claude=6   \u001b[38;5;226mprovider turn running inside bwrap\u001b[0m   "]
